==History==
2016
*The Bomb Tower [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.8 seconds).
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards &amp; Card Balance Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's attack time interval to 1.6 seconds (from 1.7 seconds).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Bomb Tower so that it would no longer stop its attack if its target dies during the attack animation.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10), and decreased the Bomb Tower's lifetime to 40 seconds (from 60 seconds). This update also fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Bomb Tower's range to 6 tiles (from 6.5 tiles), but its effective range was unchanged.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's hitpoints by 6%.
2017 
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's projectile speed to 500 (from 300).
2018 
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Bomb Tower from Bone Pit to Hog Mountain. It also fixed a bug where the Bomb Tower would occasionally stop shooting at the edge of its range.
*On 6/8/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bomb Tower's cost to 4 [[Elixir]] (from 5 Elixir), but also decreased its lifetime to 35 seconds (from 40 seconds) and its hitpoints by 33%.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's damage by 5%.
2019 
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], allowed the Bomb Tower to deal Death Damage.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bomb Tower's lifetime to 25 seconds (from 35 seconds).
2021  
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Bomb Tower's death damage by 50%.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Bomb Tower from Hog Mountain to Spooky Town.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's lifetime to 30 seconds (from 25 seconds).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/6/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Bomb Tower's card info screen.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Bomb Tower from Spooky Town to Spell Valley.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomb Tower's attack time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 1.6 seconds).

